  ],
  "rules": [
    "Treat expected JSON bytes and hashes as fixed literals; never regenerate them through production canonicalization/digest code.",
    "Pending input references are deliberately unsorted; expected canonical order is explicit. Unicode is in reference values; schema keys remain the fixed ASCII keys.",
    "Exact-empty created selection is meaningful and may not fall back to pending.",
    "Production tests also vary operation/stage/plan/reference values and reject invalid/duplicate references; these two vectors do not replace behavioral coverage."
  ]
}
